  "body": "Sharply priced - all offers will be considered!\r\n\r\nIn a market brimming with identical terraced boxes, Bayside Residences offers something genuinely different.\r\n\r\nSet on a freehold 223sqm site (more or less), with a generous floor area of over 240sqm (more or less), this brand-new, north-facing family home delivers exceptional space, flexibility and an elevated outlook over suburban Browns Bay. Zoned for Rangitoto College, the layout is also perfectly suited to extended families.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, open-plan kitchen, dining and living flow effortlessly onto the deck, with soaring ceilings and premium Bosch appliances creating a bright, contemporary space.\r\n\r\nWith four bedrooms, three and a half bathrooms, two living areas and a dedicated study nook, there is genuine room for everyone. The master suite features a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while the family bathroom includes a bathtub.\r\n\r\nThe lower level is what really sets 91C apart. A bedroom, bathroom and separate living area open onto their own balcony, creating excellent granny-flat potential - ideal for extended family, teenagers or guests.\r\n\r\nFurther features include heat pumps, underfloor heating, an internal-access garage and off-street parking.\r\n\r\nBuilt from concrete and weatherboard and backed by a 10-year Stamford Insurance warranty, this is a home designed for modern family living.\r\n\r\nBayside Drive Reserve is within walking distance, while Browns Bay and Rothesay Bay shops, cafes and beaches are just minutes away.\r\n\r\nNorth-facing, spacious and incredibly versatile - 91C shows what modern living can be when it's done properly.\r\n\r\nWelcome home.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Some images have been virtually staged for marketing purposes only.",
